From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MC-xiaonan <2106104879@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:21:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2: update-suppression fixes support (config + exception
 type)

Adds UpdateSuppressionException, the lightweight control-flow signal
thrown from known crash-prone block/block-entity race sites and caught
at tick/packet dispatch loops to skip just the offending operation
instead of crashing the server. Config toggles for the four
update-suppression sub-fixes were already wired in LcsXNMCConfig.

